# Visual-verification scratch: the shots.mjs manifests under .shots-input/ and
# every screenshot they write (.shots-after/ before/ merge/). All of it is
# regenerable from the manifests, so it stays out of the repo — and out of
# `git status` — instead of being deleted by hand after each round.
.shots-*/

